        "statement": "Major flooding can be expected along the river between Enaville and Prichard."
      },
      {
        "stage": 75.5,
        "statement": "Kingston residents on the North Fork should be prepared to move to higher ground."
      },
      {
        "stage": 74.5,
        "statement": "Flooding of some secondary roads and basements of homes near the river is likely."
      },
      {
        "stage": 72.5,
        "statement": "Minor flooding of country roads near the right bank of the Upper North Fork is possible."
      },
      {
        "stage": 71.5,
        "statement": "Minor lowland flooding is possible between Prichard and Enaville."
      },
      {
        "stage": 69,
        "statement": "Water will block access to a mobile home park on Old Coeur d'Alene River Road at Kingston. Old Coeur d'Alene River Road on the North Fork of the Coeur d'Alene River near Enaville may begin to flood north of the Bumblebee Bridge."
      },
      {
        "stage": 68,
        "statement": "Portions of Riverview Road around Kingston will be flooded, especially near Abby Road and below Fast Hill Road.  "
      },
